  "description": "<h3 data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"180\"><strong data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"178\">Product Description</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"603\">Our <strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"230\">Bamboo Pendant Light Wholesale Collection</strong> showcases the beauty of Vietnam’s traditional handwoven craftsmanship. Each lamp is meticulously made by skilled artisans in rural villages, using 100% natural bamboo sourced sustainably from local farms. The weaving process highlights not only the elegance of bamboo but also the dedication of artisans who transform raw materials into functional and artistic lighting.</p>\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"935\">By choosing bamboo pendant lights, you are not only embracing eco-friendly and biodegradable products but also supporting a meaningful cause. Every order contributes to creating stable jobs for farmers and local workers during their off-farm seasons, helping them earn additional income while preserving their cultural heritage.</p>\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1189\">Vietnam’s handicraft industry plays an important role in bringing sustainable products to global markets, while generating USD income for the country and protecting traditional cultural values through continued practice of age-old weaving techniques.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1361\">Our bamboo pendant lights are perfect for home décor, hotels, restaurants, cafés, and interior projects that value authenticity, sustainability, and handcrafted beauty.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1832\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1429\">For wholesale inquiries, please contact us directly:</strong><br data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1432\" /><strong data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1463\">VIETNAM HANDICRAFT CO., LTD</strong><br data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1466\" />Email: <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1496\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-star